  "honest_findings_and_caveats": [
    "[Suite 1 DRD1] Top-5% recall: greedy=0.6364, KB=0.6364, DPP-UCB=0.6364 (batch internal Tanimoto: greedy=0.3683 vs DPP-UCB=0.3451).",
    "[Suite 1 MAOB] Top-5% recall: greedy=0.0909, KB=0.2121, DPP-UCB=0.1212 (batch internal Tanimoto: greedy=0.3388 vs DPP-UCB=0.2966).",
    "[Suite 1 ACHE] Top-5% recall: greedy=0.6, KB=0.4333, DPP-UCB=0.5 (batch internal Tanimoto: greedy=0.4434 vs DPP-UCB=0.3426).",
    "[Suite 1 Honest Failure-Mode Contrast] On MAOB (flat/activity-cliff SAR, scaffold-CV R^2~0.18), TanimotoGP+greedy collapsed to 0.0909 (worse than random=0.1616), whereas KB/MaxMin recovered 0.2121 and EnsembleSurrogate (ECFP4+12 physchem) reached 0.3636 (2.25x random). On DRD1 and ACHE, TanimotoGP reached 4.09x-5.40x enrichment; deterministic butina_medoids + exact GP yields zero seed variance (std=0.0).",
    "[Suite 2A DRD1 Avoid-ome] Potency-only greedy top-16 Avoid-ome/MPO failure rate=0.375 vs constrained_ei=0.1875 and avoidome_feasibility_ucb=0.1875 (feasible potent hits: 14.0 vs greedy 10.0); qEHVI achieved highest 2D Pareto HV=4.389.",
    "[Suite 3 Multi-Fidelity Guardrail] Informative disjoint-scaffold ACHE proxy (true rho=0.4698) lifted Top-5% recall 0.12 -> 0.16 at equal 800-cost budget. Under adversarial QED proxy (true rho=-0.2436), ungated MF-BO suffered negative transfer (0.08), whereas correlation_gated_mf_dmta tripped guardrail 100% of seeds after 8.0 paired calls and preserved single-fidelity recall (0.12).",
    "[Suite 4 ZINC250k 60x80 Amide TS] At 7.5% budget (360 calls), argmax TS Top-50 recall=0.4333 (2.708x vs random=0.16) and Boltzmann roulette=0.2067 (1.292x); observed reagent additivity R^2=0.7002.",
